{
  "slug": "how-to-file-a-diminished-value-claim",
  "title": "How to file a diminished value claim",
  "excerpt": "Diminished Value Claims in Colorado If you’re dealing with a diminished value claim in Colorado, you’re likely seeking reimbursement for the loss in market value your vehicle suffers after an accident—even if it’s been fully restored. Colorado law permits these claims against the at-fault driver’s insurance provider, not your own policy. These claims are especially […]",
  "publishedAt": "2025-07-04T09:00:28",
  "modifiedAt": "2026-01-09T15:09:01",
  "categories": [
    "auto-accident",
    "auto-insurance-accident-claims"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b894",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s893",
          "text": "Diminished Value Claims in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l89a",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/self-help/opening-case"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s895",
          "text": "If you’re dealing with a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s896",
          "text": "diminished value claim in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s897",
          "text": ", you’re likely seeking reimbursement for the loss in market value your vehicle suffers after an accident—",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s898",
          "text": "even if it’s been fully restored.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s899",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89b",
          "text": "Colorado law",
          "marks": [
            "l89a"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89c",
          "text": " permits these claims against the at-fault driver’s insurance provider, not your own policy. These claims are especially important when resale value is critical. Whether the vehicle is leased or owned, the impact on future trade-in or sale prices can be significant. The statute of limitations is ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89d",
          "text": "two years from the date of the incident",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89e",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89h",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89g",
          "text": "What Is a Diminished Value Claim?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89k",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89i",
          "text": "A diminished value claim compensates you for the difference in your vehicle’s market value before and after an accident.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89j",
          "text": " While repairs may restore functionality and appearance, the mere fact that a vehicle has a collision history can cause a noticeable drop in resale or trade-in value. Even luxury or newer vehicles often see a significant dip in market perception after being involved in an accident. In Colorado, these claims are valid only when the other party is at fault, meaning you must file against their liability insurance, not your own. Knowing this distinction is vital when pursuing compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89m",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89l",
          "text": "Types of Diminished Value Claims in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89o",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89n",
          "text": "Inherent Diminished Value",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89r",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89p",
          "text": "This is the most prevalent type.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89q",
          "text": " It refers to the loss in value due to the vehicle’s accident history, regardless of how well it was repaired.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89t",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89s",
          "text": "Repair-Related Diminished Value",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89w",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89u",
          "text": "This occurs when the repair work is substandard",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89v",
          "text": " or when aftermarket or non-OEM parts are used, which can further reduce a vehicle’s resale potential.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b89y",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89x",
          "text": "Immediate Diminished Value",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8a4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l8a1",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/self-help/opening-case"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s89z",
          "text": "This is the difference in market value immediately after the crash but before any repairs have taken place.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8a0",
          "text": " It’s especially relevant when resale is delayed for inspection or ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8a2",
          "text": "legal action",
          "marks": [
            "l8a1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8a3",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8a6",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8a5",
          "text": "How to File a Diminished Value Claim in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8a8",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8a7",
          "text": "Gather Documentation",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8aa",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8a9",
          "text": "Collect the following:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ac",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ab",
          "text": "Police or accident report",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ae",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ad",
          "text": "Repair receipts",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ag",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8af",
          "text": "Photographs before and after repairs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ai",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ah",
          "text": "Obtain an Appraisal",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ak",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8aj",
          "text": "Hire a certified appraiser to determine your car’s pre- and post-accident value.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8am",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8al",
          "text": "Contact the At-Fault Insurance Company",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ap",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8an",
          "text": "Initiate the claim directly with the liable party’s insurer",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ao",
          "text": ", not your own.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ar",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8aq",
          "text": "Negotiate the Settlement",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8at",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8as",
          "text": "Be firm, clear, and prepared with documentation to support your valuation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8av",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8au",
          "text": "File a Lawsuit if Necessary",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ax",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8aw",
          "text": "If negotiations fail, consult a Colorado personal injury attorney to take legal action.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8az",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ay",
          "text": "Calculating Diminished Value: A Step-by-Step Guide",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8b1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8b0",
          "text": "Determining the exact amount of diminished value requires a structured, evidence-based approach. Many insurers rely on variations of the 17c Diminished Value Formula to estimate the loss.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8b3",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8b2",
          "text": "Step 1: Determine the Value of Your Car",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8b5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8b4",
          "text": "The first step is assessing the car’s pre-accident market value using sources like Kelley Blue Book, NADA, or dealership appraisals. These references help establish a fair baseline.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8b7",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8b6",
          "text": "Step 2: Apply a 10% Cap to That Value",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8b9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8b8",
          "text": "Many insurers limit the total diminished value compensation to 10%. This means the most an insurer may consider for reimbursement is typically 10% of the vehicle’s pre-accident market value. However, this figure can vary depending on the insurance company’s evaluation process.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bb",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ba",
          "text": "Step 3: Apply a Damage Multiplier",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bc",
          "text": "The extent of damage significantly affects the diminished value claim. Insurers apply a damage multiplier based on severity:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8be",
          "text": "1.00 – Severe structural damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bg",
          "text": "0.75 – Major damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bi",
          "text": "0.50 – Moderate damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bk",
          "text": "0.25 – Minor damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bm",
          "text": "0.00 – No structural damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bp",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bo",
          "text": "Step 4: Apply a Mileage Multiplier",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8br",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bq",
          "text": "Mileage impacts a vehicle’s resale value. A low-mileage car retains more value, whereas high mileage results in a lower claim amount. Common mileage multipliers include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bs",
          "text": "1.00 – Under 20,000 miles",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bu",
          "text": "0.80 – 20,000 to 39,999 miles",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8bw",
          "text": "0.60 – 40,000 to 59,999 miles",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8bz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8by",
          "text": "0.40 – 60,000 to 79,999 miles",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8c1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8c0",
          "text": "0.20 – 80,000 to 99,999 miles",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8c3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8c2",
          "text": "0.00 – Over 100,000 miles",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8c5",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8c4",
          "text": "When Should You File a Diminished Value Claim?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8c9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8c6",
          "text": "Timing can significantly impact ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8c7",
          "text": "how to file a diminished value claim",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8c8",
          "text": " successfully. Acting promptly strengthens your case. Consider filing in these situations:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8cb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ca",
          "text": "Immediately after repairs: Once repairs are completed, assess the car’s post-accident value to determine any loss.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8cd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8cc",
          "text": "Before selling or trading the vehicle, Filing beforehand ensures you don’t personally absorb the loss and helps negotiate a better price.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8cf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ce",
          "text": "If the vehicle suffered major structural damage, the severity of the damage generally results in a stronger claim with greater potential compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8ch",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8cg",
          "text": "Before the three-year statute of limitations expires: Waiting too long can jeopardize your ability to recover compensation and strengthen your case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8cj",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ci",
          "text": "Important Considerations",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8cl",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ck",
          "text": "Statute of Limitations",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8co",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8cm",
          "text": "You have two years from the date of the accident",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8cn",
          "text": " to initiate your diminished value claim in Colorado.",
